          "text": "Kandi Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda n’abaganwa biwe nzobatanga mu maboko y’abansi babo, no mu maboko y’ababahīga ngo babice, no mu maboko y’ingabo z’umwami w’i Babuloni zari zabaretse zikabavako. ",
